  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A collection of three programs: Sea Battle, Mathematical Battle, Calculator. Sea Battle plays just like the board-game of Battleship, with players taking turns firing at spaces the other player may have their ship. Mathematical Battle plays as ab educational game where you control the fire of anti-aircraft guns shooting at UFO's by answering a math equation at the top of the screen. Earning enough points earns a bonus volleyball game the player can play.  Calculator is exactly what it says and will bring up a calculator."
    }
